  <LanguagePacks><LanguagePack ID="ENU" IsDefault="true"><DisplayStrings>
        <DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Overrides.HyperVOverSMB.Standard.Discovery"><Name>Hyper-V Private Cloud Monitoring - HyperVOverSMB Standard Discovery Overrides</Name><Description>Unsealed, customer-owned Standard starter overrides for the HyperVOverSMB deployment profile. Review in a test management group, customize locally, and export after every change.</Description></DisplayString>
